  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Right tree, Right place, Right product</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collecting 1 million seeds of Zambia&apos;s indigenous trees best suited to maximising carbon storage and reducing effects of climate change.  Not all trees produce seeds each year so we will develop a seed bank to store and maintain seeds when they become available, until the most opportune time to plant.   Smallholder farming communities will get skills in establishing tree nurseries and tree planting schemes so they can take ownership of forest regeneration that also improves their livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
